{"page":340,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:65","surah":22,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَخَّرَ لَكُم مَّا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَٱلْفُلْكَ تَجْرِى فِى ٱلْبَحْرِ بِأَمْرِهِۦ وَيُمْسِكُ ٱلسَّمَآءَ أَن تَقَعَ عَلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِهِۦٓ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِٱلنَّاسِ لَرَءُوفٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Have you not considered how God has made everything on the earth of service to you? That ships sail the sea at His command? That He keeps the heavens from falling down on the earth without His permission? God is most compassionate and most merciful to mankind-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَخَّرَ","en_gloss":"(has) subjected","transliteration":"sakhara","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلْفُلْكَ","en_gloss":"and the ships","transliteration":"wal-ful'ka","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"that sail","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"through","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","en_gloss":"the sea","transliteration":"l-baḥri","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ","en_gloss":"by His Command","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","verse_key":"22:65"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَيُمْسِكُ","en_gloss":"And He withholds","transliteration":"wayum'siku","verse_